# INT unit (#107): tests/functional/30_foreach_mutation.my under the
# LEGACY register pick (the lsra lever off). Its loops hoist a second
# element base where the pins would leave fewer than two callee-saved
# registers, so jit_compile_chunk must decide what the base's register
# pair costs: no pin (they are displaced), or the coldest pins, dropped
# when the pair is worth more - the second an arm the linear scan never
# takes. No other unit reaches either. The program prints and asserts
# nothing: the tree-walker's output, which the lever does not change,
# is the oracle (INT-SOURCE: no second copy).
